.Dd October 4, 2026
.Dt APKBUILD_BUMP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm apkbuild_bump
.Nd rewrite an APKBUILD's pkgver and sha512sums for a new release
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar apkbuild
.Ar version
.Ar sha512-hex
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
does the part of a release that is easy to get wrong by hand.  It validates its
inputs and rewrites the
.Va pkgver
line and the
.Va sha512sums
block of an APKBUILD, pointing the checksum at the new tarball name
.Pq Ar pkgname Ns -v Ns Ar version Ns Pa .tar.gz .
.Pp
It handles both the single-line and multi-line
.Va sha512sums
forms and preserves whichever the file uses.  It reads and writes the file
byte-for-byte, so a no-op bump \(em same version and hash \(em leaves the file
unchanged, and the write goes to a
.Pa .tmp
file that is renamed into place.
.Pp
.Nm
is not usually run by hand; see
.Xr release-checksum 1 ,
which fetches the tarball, hashes it, and calls
.Nm .
.Sh ARGUMENTS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ar apkbuild
Path to the APKBUILD to rewrite.
.It Ar version
The new version,
.Ql d.d.d .
.It Ar sha512-hex
The 128-character hex sha512 of the new tarball.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr release-checksum 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.Nm
and
.Xr release-checksum 1
were written for the
.Lk https://github.com/moebiusV/ada-on-alpine ada-on-alpine
overlay.
